# {{.Title}}

An axon app (`{{.Name}}`): one core host plus its modules under `modules/<token>/module`.

| Goal | Command |
|---|---|
| Add a module | `axon app add module <name>` |
| Validate the app and your toolchain | `axon app check` |
| Run every module's tests | `axon app test` |
| Build its images | `axon app build` |
| Run it against the cluster | `axon app run` |

Each module is a gRPC/HTTP server (`service/`), a UI bundle (`ui/`) and its own
database schema (`database/`).
